          ],
          "content": "Learning further"
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.549,
            0.081,
            0.674,
            0.153
          ],
          "content": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.164,
            0.744,
            0.225
          ],
          "content": " Make a field trip to a local garden. Interact with a gardener to learn about various conditions and the time required for the growth of various plants."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.231,
            0.743,
            0.271
          ],
          "content": " Can we grow plants without germinating their seeds? Explore and cite some examples."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.277,
            0.744,
            0.359
          ],
          "content": " Observe the life cycle of five plants grown at home, school, or in a nearby garden. Create a picture book containing pictures of various stages of their growth. Write the name of each plant and the duration of each of its stage."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.365,
            0.743,
            0.426
          ],
          "content": " Try to observe some of the stages in the life cycle of a butterfly or a moth. Are these stages similar to the stages in the life cycle of a mosquito?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.432,
            0.743,
            0.492
          ],
          "content": "In your opinion, would the environment affect the life cycles of insects? Explore and list the factors that affect the life cycles of insects."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.329,
            0.565,
            0.525,
            0.587
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Let us create"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.618,
            0.744,
            0.702
          ],
          "content": "Add more lines to the incomplete poem given below. Include information on the different stages in development of a frog. You may also draw and paint each stage as it appears in your poem."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.72,
            0.489,
            0.741
          ],
          "content": "In shaded and grassy bogs,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.741,
            0.499,
            0.762
          ],
          "content": "There lived a group of frogs."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.208,
            0.761,
            0.601,
            0.782
          ],
          "content": "They happily sang from dusk to dawn,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.782,
            0.536,
            0.802
          ],
          "content": "In double bass going on and on."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.802,
            0.511,
            0.822
          ],
          "content": "One day sitting beside a reed,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.823,
            0.631,
            0.843
          ],
          "content": "Female frogs think it’s time to breed …….."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.85,
            0.515,
            0.864
          ],
          "content": "…………………………………………"
